SUMMARY:But I'm A Cheerleader (1999) - Laugh Out Loud Pride Film Screenings
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a FREE screening the cult classic film\, “But I’m A Cheerleader” to kick off Pride this year at Montclair Public Library! The screening will be followed by a open panel discussion about the film with queer film maker Abigail Espinal and FDU Professor Cordelia Siporin. Free snacks and drinks will be provided by Lotus Lemonade & Kettecorn. These screenings are proudly co-presented by Pride Center of Montclair. Come join in the fun and bring a friend! \n“A naive teenager is sent to “sexual redirection” camp when her straitlaced parents and friends suspect her of being gay. With Natasha Lyonne.” \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/but-im-a-cheerleader-1999-laugh-out-loud-pride-film-screenings/
LOCATION:Montclair Public Library\, 50 South Fullerton Avenue\, Montclair\, New Jersey\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Comedy,Entertainment,Film
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/ButImACheerleaderFlyerandSocial.png
