SUMMARY:Sound Bath Meditation
DESCRIPTION:Step into a cocoon of calm with this immersive Sound Bath Meditation. Guided by soothing tones from crystal singing bowls\, chimes\, and gentle vibrations\, you’ll sink into a state of deep relaxation. Feel tension melt away as the rhythmic soundscape quiets your mind and restores your energy. Leave refreshed\, centered\, and renewed\, carrying a sense of calm into your day. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
