SUMMARY:Community Wednesday: Family Promise Essex at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Community Wednesdays is a select Wednesday where we highlight one local non-profit\, and where a portion of proceeds will be donated to. This week’s non-profit is Family Promise Essex\, whose mission is to help homeless and at-risk families achieve self-sufficiency by providing housing and shelter\, social services\, and community connections through collaboration\, education\, direct service\, and advocacy. Their vision is a community in which every family has a home\, a livelihood\, and the opportunity to build a better future. \nHelp us support this organization by visiting\, learning more about the work they do\, and contributing to a good cause! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/community-wednesday-family-promise-essex-at-montclair-brewery/
LOCATION:Montclair Brewery\, 101 Walnut Street\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community,Entertainment,Kids & Families
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/6.10-Community-Wednesdays-Family-Promise-Essex.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Brewery":MAILTO:Staff@montclairbrewery.com
END:VEVENT
