SUMMARY:Once Upon A Prom: An Enchanting Evening Benefiting The Montclair Inn
DESCRIPTION:Dance the night away while supporting The Montclair Inn\, a nonprofit providing affordable housing and community for seniors on fixed incomes. \n📅 Thursday\, June 11\, 2026\n🕡 6:30 PM\n📍 The Loft Montclair\, 8 Lackawanna Plaza \nEnjoy music\, dancing\, drinks\, light bites\, and a chance to celebrate some incredible community honorees while supporting a great cause. \nEvery ticket helps The Montclair Inn continue providing safe\, affordable housing and dignity for older adults in our community. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
