SUMMARY:Crafty: A Pride Craft Night
DESCRIPTION:Crafty is like a paint and sip\, but even draggier! It’s a space to work on a craft project\, mingle with other crafters\, and to enjoy some fierce drag. With stations for bedazzling\, sketching\, and sewing\, you can bring a project of your own or find one here. Add some sparkle to your wardrobe\, create a headpiece\, fix a hole in a shirt\, the world is your oyster. Plus\, local crafty drag queen Mora Monáe will be hosting\, performing\, and crafting with you! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
