SUMMARY:CreativeMornings: April Acerno
DESCRIPTION:CreativeMornings is a free monthly breakfast lecture series for anyone who identifies as creative (yes\, that means you!). With 250+ chapters in 70 countries\, we’re thrilled to host the first & only NJ chapter in Montclair! \nThis month\, our global theme is “Curate” and our speaker is April Acerno! Acerno is a vinyl DJ and the editor-in-chief of Eighty-Six’d\, a local print magazine highlighting artists\, small business owners\, and other creatives in Essex County. A passionate community advocate\, she organizes free events throughout the Montclair area\, including art events\, dance parties\, and crafting meetups. Whether through her DJing or magazine platform\, she strives to create spaces that are inclusive\, accessible\, and reflective of the diversity that makes our community beautiful. \nCan’t wait to see you there! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/creativemornings-april-acerno/
LOCATION:RecRoom\, 1 Lackawanna Plaza\, Ste. 6\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art & Culture,Community
