SUMMARY:Resilience Through Art: Celebrating LGBTQ+ Expression – Opening Reception
DESCRIPTION:The Eclectic Chic Boutique and Keep Creating Art Wellness Center proudly present “Resilience Through Art: Celebrating LGBTQ+ Expression”. Join us in a celebration of the diverse voices\, experiences\, and creativity of the LGBTQ+ community. \nCurated by Kristen Zachares and Mia Cohn of The Eclectic Chic Boutique\, this exhibition will feature a diverse collection of artwork created by LGBTQ+ artists\, highlighting personal stories\, joy\, struggle\, transformation\, and resilience through a wide range of artistic styles and mediums. From painting and illustration to mixed media and fiber arts\, the show aims to create an inclusive and welcoming space where art becomes both celebration and conversation. \n20% of art sales will donated to OutMontclair\, a local nonprofit providing community programing and organizers of Montclair’s iconic Montclair Pride event. Visit OutMontclair.org for more information. \nThe exhibition will be on display at Keep Creating Art Wellness Center and runs June 11th thru July 7th. Opening reception is June 12th. Light refreshments will be served. \nKeep Creating Art Wellness Center is a nonprofit art studio dedicated to inclusiveness and acceptance of all individuals\, regardless of their abilities and levels of experience. They believe in the power of art to transform lives and foster wellness for all. Visit www.keepcreatingcorp.com for more information. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/resilience-through-art-celebrating-lgbtq-expression-opening-reception/
LOCATION:keep creating art wellness center\, 408 Bloomfield ave\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:General Events
