SUMMARY:Pressed Flowers on Ceramic Jewelry Dish Resin Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Create your own floral resin dish in this hands-on workshop! You’ll design a 4.5” white ceramic dish using real pressed flowers\, arranging them into a unique composition before sealing them in clear resin. We’ll cover the basics of placement and techniques for a smooth\, polished finish. Perfect for beginners\, this class is both creative and relaxing—and you’ll leave with a beautiful\, one-of-a-kind piece. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
