SUMMARY:WFMU DJ Bands at The Porchistas
DESCRIPTION:The bands of a bunch of FMU affiliated folks live outdoors at the Porchistas house. Weather permitting\, this will be an outdoors show. If it rains we’ll move it inside.\ndoors 4pm. \nBonce – Songs with great hooks that explore the intersections of evolving technologies and material reality. https://bonce.bandcamp.com/ \nALÂN – Sophisticated prog-pop trio featuring Brooklyn-based WFMU affiliates Sheila Burgel and Bill Bowen. \nThe Porchistas will be playing a bunch of new songs currently being recorded for their next record ‘In Case You Forgot’ https://theporchistas.bandcamp.com/ \nHoof & Mouth Slimfonia – featuring WFMU DJs Faye\, Dave Mandl\, Greg from Zone 5 and Sheila B playing tasty covers like only FMU folks can \nStepford Wives – noisy melodic freakout folk https://stepfordwivesband.bandcamp.com/album/bonnie\n$15 at the door to pay the bands \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
