SUMMARY:Fire In The Annex live at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Fire in The Annex is a New Jersey-based band delivering a fun\, fresh take on pop and rock anthems with a hard rock edge and locked-in grooves. Fronted by powerhouse vocalist Erica Taylor\, the band blends familiar classics with a dynamic sound that’s tight\, tasteful\, and will make you want to dance!. Fire in The Annex features a lineup of seasoned musicians\, including drummer Ulises Negrete\, whose impressive career includes performances with Bob Weir of the Grateful Dead\, Ronnie Wood of The Rolling Stones\, and a collaboration with legendary guitarist George Lynch of Dokken. \n$5 cover charge per person that goes directly to the artists. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
